# Styling preference

When adding or changing UI styling:

1. **Tailwind** utilities in the template first (`tailwind.config.js` theme tokens: `bg-card`, `text-t1`, etc.).
2. **`<style scoped>`** last — mostly unique values, animations, transitions, `@apply` bundles, or things TW cannot express.

Details and exceptions: **`docs/CONVENTIONS.md`** (CSS units / theme / opacity modifiers).
